    "enUS": {
      "description": "I have never seen such wondrous results from a poison! Zanzil you say? Never heard of him, however, I must commend him on the creation of this concoction.\n\nSo, I am to cure you of this and then teach you how to make use of the poison?\n\nGive me a few moments to examine the toxin, {name}.",
      "eventObjectiveLabel": "Cure Completed",
      "summary": "Wait for Serge Hinott to complete the cure.",
      "title": "Hinott's Assistance",
